                                                                                
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
*                                                                      *        
*  PROGRAM    :  W5129100                                              *        
*                                                                      *        
*  FUNCTION   :  CREATE LISTS OF MONTH'S DIRECT DELIVERY REPORT        *        
*                                                                      *        
*  AUTHOR     :  SARASWATHY S                                          *        
*                                                                      *        
*----------------------------------------------------------------------*        
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
FILE W51291D1                                                                   
*                                                                               
%W57069  'IN-'                                                                  
*---------------------------------------------*                                 
*TEMPFIL                                      *                                 
*---------------------------------------------*                                 
FILE TPFIL1 FB(61 0)                                                            
%W57069  'T1-'                                                                  
                                                                                
*---------------------------------------------*                                 
*TEMPFIL                                      *                                 
*---------------------------------------------*                                 
FILE TPFIL2 FB(61 0)                                                            
%W57069  'T2-'                                                                  
                                                                                
****** EXCELENS UTFIL                                                           
FILE W51291D2 PRINTER VB(57   0)                                                
                                                                                
****** EXCELENS 2:A TOM X:TE RAD                                                
UT-IDDC          W   2  A                                                       
UT-KDPRODSL      W   2  A                                                       
UT-KDTRADP       W   4  A                                                       
UT-TEXT          W   30 A                                                       
UT-SUMMA-N       W   11 N                                                       
UT-SUMMA-D       W   2  N                                                       
                                                                                
****** EXCELENS UTFIL                                                           
FILE W51291D3 PRINTER VB(165  0)                                                
                                                                                
UT1-IDDISTR         W 5  N                                                      
UT1-IDKUNDNR        W 7  N                                                      
UT1-IDORDNR         W 5  N                                                      
UT1-IDARTNR         W 9  N                                                      
UT1-IDDC            W 2  A                                                      
UT1-KDPRODSL        W 2  N                                                      
UT1-KDEKHHT         W 3  A                                                      
UT1-KDEKSHT         W 3  A                                                      
UT1-KVANTAL         W 7  N                                                      
UT1-PRARTSTD-N      W 11 N                                                      
UT1-PRARTSTD-D      W 2  N                                                      
UT1-PRARTSUM-N      W 11 N                                                      
UT1-PRARTSUM-D      W 2  N                                                      
UT1-IDVERGL         W 10 A                                                      
UT1-DAVERDAT        W 8 N                                                       
UT1-PRLANDCO-N      W 7 N                                                       
UT1-PRLANDCO-D      W 2 N                                                       
                                                                                
****** EXCELENS FÖRSTA RAD                                                      
RUB-DATUM        W   6  N                                                       
RUB-MÅNAD        W   2  N                                                       
                                                                                
%WDATKORT                                                                       
                                                                                
*-------------*                                                                 
* ARBETSAREOR *                                                                 
*-------------*                                                                 
W-PREV-KDTRADP   W   4 A                                                        
W-PREV-KDTRADP1  W   4 A                                                        
W-KDVALISO       W   3 A                                                        
W-IDDC           W   2 A    VALUE '  '                                          
W-KDPRODSL       W   2 N    VALUE 0                                             
W-KDTRADP        W   4 A    VALUE '    '                                        
W-SUNETT         W   8 P 2  VALUE 0                                             
W-KVANTAL        W   5 P 0  VALUE  0                                            
IX               W   2 P 0                                                      
W-SEM            W   1 A    VALUE ';'                                           
W-DECIMAL        W   1 A    VALUE '.'                                           
                                                                                
W-SUNETT-FMT                     W  13  N 2                                     
W-SUNETT-N       W-SUNETT-FMT       11  N                                       
W-SUNETT-D       W-SUNETT-FMT +11   2   N                                       
                                                                                
W-PRARTSTD-FMT                   W  13  N 2                                     
W-PRARTSTD-N     W-PRARTSTD-FMT     11  N                                       
W-PRARTSTD-D     W-PRARTSTD-FMT +11  2  N                                       
                                                                                
W-PRARTSTD-TOT                    W  13  N 2                                    
W-PRARTSTD-TOT-N  W-PRARTSTD-TOT     11  N                                      
W-PRARTSTD-TOT-D  W-PRARTSTD-TOT +11  2  N                                      
                                                                                
W-PRLANDCO-FMT                    W  13  N 2                                    
W-PRLANDCO-FMT-N  W-PRLANDCO-FMT     11  N                                      
W-PRLANDCO-FMT-D  W-PRLANDCO-FMT +11  2  N                                      
                                                                                
PROGRAM-NAMN     W   6   A  VALUE 'W51291'                                      
DATUMKORT-ID     W   6   A  VALUE 'WDATUM'                                      
                                                                                
W-AAMMDD         W   6   N                                                      
W-AA   W-AAMMDD      2   N                                                      
W-MM   W-AAMMDD  +2  2   N                                                      
W-DD   W-AAMMDD  +4  2   N                                                      
                                                                                
BEPRODSL                W 27  A    OCCURS 98                                    
BEPRODSL-PS  BEPRODSL      2  A                                                 
BEPRODSL-TXT BEPRODSL +3  24  A                                                 
                                                                                
NEWPAGE                                                                         
                                                                                
*--------------------------------------------------------*                      
* STEP 1 SORT W51290 WITH IDDC, KDPRODSL AND KDTRADP                            
*--------------------------------------------------------*                      
                                                                                
SORT W51291D1 TO TPFIL1 USING  +                                                
                 (IN-DIR-KDTRADP IN-DIR-KDPRODSL IN-DIR-IDDC) +                 
                 SIZE 900000                                                    
*--------------------------------------------------------*                      
* STEP 2 READ FILE W51290 TO CREATE THE REPORT                                  
*--------------------------------------------------------*                      
JOB INPUT (TPFIL1 KEY(T1-DIR-KDTRADP T1-DIR-KDPRODSL T1-DIR-IDDC)) +            
                 START A-INIT                                                   
     IF T1-DIR-IDDC = W-IDDC AND T1-DIR-KDPRODSL = W-KDPRODSL +                 
      AND T1-DIR-KDTRADP = W-KDTRADP                                            
        W-SUNETT = W-SUNETT + (T1-DIR-PRARTSTD * T1-DIR-KVANTAL)                
     ELSE                                                                       
        W-IDDC             = T1-DIR-IDDC                                        
        W-KDPRODSL         = T1-DIR-KDPRODSL                                    
        W-KDTRADP          = T1-DIR-KDTRADP                                     
        W-SUNETT           = T1-DIR-PRARTSTD * T1-DIR-KVANTAL                   
     END-IF                                                                     
     IF LAST-DUP  TPFIL1 OR NOT DUPLICATE TPFIL1                                
      PERFORM SKRIV-EXCELPOST-1                                                 
      IF W-KDTRADP NE ' '                                                       
        PRINT REPORT01                                                          
      END-IF                                                                    
     END-IF                                                                     
                                                                                
SKRIV-EXCELPOST-1. PROC                                                         
  UT-IDDC     = W-IDDC                                                          
  UT-KDPRODSL = W-KDPRODSL                                                      
  UT-KDTRADP  = W-KDTRADP                                                       
  IX = 1                                                                        
  DO WHILE IX LE 98                                                             
    IF BEPRODSL-PS(IX) EQ UT-KDPRODSL                                           
      UT-TEXT     = BEPRODSL-TXT(IX)                                            
      IX = 99                                                                   
    END-IF                                                                      
    IX = IX + 1                                                                 
  END-DO                                                                        
  W-SUNETT-FMT  = W-SUNETT                                                      
  UT-SUMMA-N    = W-SUNETT-N                                                    
  UT-SUMMA-D    = W-SUNETT-D                                                    
END-PROC                                                                        
                                                                                
A-INIT. PROC                                                                    
  CALL DATKORT USING (PROGRAM-NAMN DATUMKORT-ID DATUMKORT)                      
  W-AA       = D-AAR                                                            
  W-MM       = D-MAANAD                                                         
  W-DD       = D-DAG                                                            
  RUB-DATUM  = W-AAMMDD                                                         
  RUB-MÅNAD  = W-MM                                                             
                                                                                
****  INITIERA TABELLER ******                                                  
  BEPRODSL(01) =       '11 SPARE PARTS VCC'                                     
  BEPRODSL(02) =       '12                '                                     
  BEPRODSL(03) =       '13 CHEMICALS VCCS'                                      
  BEPRODSL(04) =       '14 EXCHANGE VCC'                                        
  BEPRODSL(05) =       '15 ACCESSORIES VCC'                                     
  BEPRODSL(06) =       '16 RADIO VCC/COMPLETE WHEELS'                           
  BEPRODSL(07) =       '17 TELEPHONES VCC'                                      
  BEPRODSL(08) =       '18 TOOLS VCC'                                           
  BEPRODSL(09) =       '19 PACKAGING VCC'                                       
  BEPRODSL(10) =       '20              '                                       
  BEPRODSL(11) =       '21 SPARE PARTS 300/400'                                 
  BEPRODSL(12) =       '22                    '                                 
  BEPRODSL(13) =       '23 CHEMICALS 300/400'                                   
  BEPRODSL(14) =       '24 EXCHANGE 300/400'                                    
  BEPRODSL(15) =       '25 ACCESSORIES 300/400'                                 
  BEPRODSL(16) =       '26 RADIO 300/400'                                       
  BEPRODSL(17) =       '27 AUDIO 300/400'                                       
  BEPRODSL(18) =       '28 TELEPHONES 300/400'                                  
  BEPRODSL(19) =       '29 PACKAGING 300/400'                                   
  BEPRODSL(20) =       '30                  '                                   
  BEPRODSL(21) =       '31 SPARE PARTS RENAULT'                                 
  BEPRODSL(22) =       '32                    '                                 
  BEPRODSL(23) =       '33 CHEMICALS RENAULT'                                   
  BEPRODSL(24) =       '34 EXCHANGE RENAULT'                                    
  BEPRODSL(25) =       '35 ACCESSORIES RENAULT'                                 
  BEPRODSL(26) =       '36                    '                                 
  BEPRODSL(27) =       '37                    '                                 
  BEPRODSL(28) =       '38 TOOLS RENAULT'                                       
  BEPRODSL(29) =       '39              '                                       
  BEPRODSL(30) =       '40              '                                       
  BEPRODSL(31) =       '41              '                                       
  BEPRODSL(32) =       '42              '                                       
  BEPRODSL(33) =       '43              '                                       
  BEPRODSL(34) =       '44              '                                       
  BEPRODSL(35) =       '45              '                                       
  BEPRODSL(36) =       '46              '                                       
  BEPRODSL(37) =       '47              '                                       
  BEPRODSL(38) =       '48              '                                       
  BEPRODSL(39) =       '49              '                                       
  BEPRODSL(40) =       '50              '                                       
  BEPRODSL(41) =       '51 PARTS POLESTAR'                                      
  BEPRODSL(42) =       '52               '                                      
  BEPRODSL(43) =       '53 CHEMICAL POLES'                                      
  BEPRODSL(44) =       '54 EXCHANGE POLESTAR'                                   
  BEPRODSL(45) =       '55 ACCESSORIES POL'                                     
  BEPRODSL(46) =       '56 AUDIO POLESTAR'                                      
  BEPRODSL(47) =       '57 TELEPHONES POLE'                                     
  BEPRODSL(48) =       '58 TOOLS POLESTAR'                                      
  BEPRODSL(49) =       '59 PACKING POLESTA'                                     
  BEPRODSL(50) =       '60                '                                     
  BEPRODSL(51) =       '61 SPARE PARTS LAND ROVER'                              
  BEPRODSL(52) =       '62                '                                     
  BEPRODSL(53) =       '63 CHEMICALS LAND ROVER'                                
  BEPRODSL(54) =       '64 EXCHANGE LAND ROVER'                                 
  BEPRODSL(55) =       '65 ACCESSORIES LAND ROVER'                              
  BEPRODSL(56) =       '66 RADIO LAND ROVER'                                    
  BEPRODSL(57) =       '67 TELEPHONES LAND ROVER'                               
  BEPRODSL(58) =       '68 TOOLS LAND ROVER'                                    
  BEPRODSL(59) =       '69 PACKAGING LAND ROVER'                                
  BEPRODSL(60) =       '70                 '                                    
  BEPRODSL(61) =       '71 CONSUMPTION BIMA'                                    
  BEPRODSL(62) =       '72 CONSUMER BIMA'                                       
  BEPRODSL(63) =       '73 DEX BIMA'                                            
  BEPRODSL(64) =       '74 TOOLS BIMA'                                          
  BEPRODSL(65) =       '75           '                                          
  BEPRODSL(66) =       '76           '                                          
  BEPRODSL(67) =       '77           '                                          
  BEPRODSL(68) =       '78           '                                          
  BEPRODSL(69) =       '79           '                                          
  BEPRODSL(70) =       '80           '                                          
  BEPRODSL(71) =       '81           '                                          
  BEPRODSL(72) =       '82           '                                          
  BEPRODSL(73) =       '83           '                                          
  BEPRODSL(74) =       '84           '                                          
  BEPRODSL(75) =       '85           '                                          
  BEPRODSL(76) =       '86           '                                          
  BEPRODSL(77) =       '87           '                                          
  BEPRODSL(78) =       '88           '                                          
  BEPRODSL(79) =       '89           '                                          
  BEPRODSL(80) =       '90           '                                          
  BEPRODSL(81) =       '91 SPARE PARTS LOC'                                     
  BEPRODSL(82) =       '92           '                                          
  BEPRODSL(83) =       '93 CHEMICALS LOC'                                       
  BEPRODSL(84) =       '94 EXCHANGE LOC'                                        
  BEPRODSL(85) =       '95 ACCESSORIES LOC'                                     
  BEPRODSL(86) =       '96 RADIO LOC'                                           
  BEPRODSL(87) =       '97 TELEPHONES LOC'                                      
  BEPRODSL(88) =       '98 TOOLS LOC'                                           
  BEPRODSL(89) =       '99 PACKAGING LOC'                                       
END-PROC                                                                        
************************************************************************        
*** LIST FOR NON VCC - SENT TO D&P                                              
************************************************************************        
  REPORT   REPORT01             +                                               
           PRINTER W51291D2     +                                               
           LINESIZE 52          +                                               
           SPACE 0              +                                               
           NOHEADING            +                                               
           NOSPREAD             +                                               
           NOADJUST             +                                               
           PAGESIZE 32767       +                                               
           NODATE                                                               
LINE  1  UT-IDDC              +                                                 
         W-SEM                +                                                 
         UT-KDPRODSL          +                                                 
         W-SEM                +                                                 
         UT-TEXT              +                                                 
         W-SEM                +                                                 
         UT-SUMMA-N           +                                                 
         W-DECIMAL            +                                                 
         UT-SUMMA-D           +                                                 
         W-SEM                                                                  
*                                                                               
BEFORE-LINE. PROC                                                               
 IF W-KDTRADP NE W-PREV-KDTRADP                                                 
   DISPLAY '¤DAPW51291A-001'                                                    
   DISPLAY '¤DAP' W-KDTRADP                                                     
   DISPLAY 'DATE' RUB-DATUM ';PERIOD' RUB-MÅNAD ';'                             
   DISPLAY 'DC;PRODUCT GROUP;DESCRIPTION;TOTAL PRICE;'                          
   W-PREV-KDTRADP = W-KDTRADP                                                   
 END-IF                                                                         
END-PROC                                                                        
*--------------------------------------------------------*                      
* STEP 3 SORT W51291D1 ON DC, PART NUMBER AND TRADING PARTNER                   
*--------------------------------------------------------*                      
                                                                                
SORT W51291D1 TO TPFIL2 USING                                 +                 
                    (IN-DIR-KDTRADP IN-DIR-KDPRODSL IN-DIR-IDDC) +              
                             SIZE 900000                                        
JOB INPUT TPFIL2                                                                
                                                                                
  W-KDTRADP      = T2-DIR-KDTRADP                                               
                                                                                
  UT1-IDDC       = T2-DIR-IDDC                                                  
  UT1-IDDISTR    = T2-DIR-IDDISTR                                               
  UT1-IDKUNDNR   = T2-DIR-IDKUNDNR                                              
  UT1-IDORDNR    = T2-DIR-IDORDNR5                                              
  UT1-IDARTNR    = T2-DIR-IDARTNR                                               
  UT1-KDPRODSL   = T2-DIR-KDPRODSL                                              
  UT1-KDEKHHT    = T2-DIR-KDEKHHT                                               
  UT1-KDEKSHT    = T2-DIR-KDEKSHT                                               
  UT1-KVANTAL    = T2-DIR-KVANTAL                                               
  UT1-IDVERGL    = T2-DIR-IDVERGL                                               
  UT1-DAVERDAT   = T2-DIR-DAVERDAT                                              
                                                                                
  W-PRARTSTD-FMT = T2-DIR-PRARTSTD                                              
  UT1-PRARTSTD-N = W-PRARTSTD-N                                                 
  UT1-PRARTSTD-D = W-PRARTSTD-D                                                 
                                                                                
  W-PRARTSTD-TOT = T2-DIR-PRARTSTD * T2-DIR-KVANTAL                             
  UT1-PRARTSUM-N = W-PRARTSTD-TOT-N                                             
  UT1-PRARTSUM-D = W-PRARTSTD-TOT-D                                             
                                                                                
  W-PRLANDCO-FMT = T2-DIR-PRLANDCO                                              
  UT1-PRLANDCO-N = W-PRLANDCO-FMT-N                                             
  UT1-PRLANDCO-D = W-PRLANDCO-FMT-D                                             
                                                                                
  PRINT REPORT02                                                                
                                                                                
************************************************************************        
*** LIST FOR NON VCC - SENT TO D&P - PART LEVEL                                 
************************************************************************        
  REPORT   REPORT02             +                                               
           PRINTER W51291D3     +                                               
           LINESIZE 160         +                                               
           SPACE 0              +                                               
           NOHEADING            +                                               
           NOSPREAD             +                                               
           NOADJUST             +                                               
           PAGESIZE 32767       +                                               
           NODATE                                                               
LINE  1  UT1-IDDISTR            +                                               
         W-SEM                  +                                               
         UT1-IDKUNDNR           +                                               
         W-SEM                  +                                               
         UT1-IDORDNR            +                                               
         W-SEM                  +                                               
         UT1-IDARTNR            +                                               
         W-SEM                  +                                               
         UT1-IDDC               +                                               
         W-SEM                  +                                               
         UT1-KDPRODSL           +                                               
         W-SEM                  +                                               
         UT1-KDEKHHT            +                                               
         W-SEM                  +                                               
         UT1-KDEKSHT            +                                               
         W-SEM                  +                                               
         UT1-KVANTAL            +                                               
         W-SEM                  +                                               
         UT1-PRARTSTD-N         +                                               
         W-DECIMAL              +                                               
         UT1-PRARTSTD-D         +                                               
         W-SEM                  +                                               
         UT1-PRARTSUM-N         +                                               
         W-DECIMAL              +                                               
         UT1-PRARTSUM-D         +                                               
         W-SEM                  +                                               
         UT1-IDVERGL            +                                               
         W-SEM                  +                                               
         UT1-DAVERDAT           +                                               
         W-SEM                  +                                               
         UT1-PRLANDCO-N         +                                               
         W-DECIMAL              +                                               
         UT1-PRLANDCO-D         +                                               
         W-SEM                                                                  
*                                                                               
BEFORE-LINE. PROC                                                               
 IF W-KDTRADP NE W-PREV-KDTRADP1                                                
   DISPLAY '¤DAPW51291B-001'                                                    
   DISPLAY '¤DAP' W-KDTRADP                                                     
   DISPLAY 'DISTRICT;CUSTOMER;ORDER NUMBER;PART NUMBER;DC;'       +             
           'PRODUCT GROUP;EVENT;SUB EVENT;QUANTITY;STD PRICE;'    +             
           'SUM;VERIFICATION;DATE;LANDING COST;'                                
   W-PREV-KDTRADP1 = W-KDTRADP                                                  
 END-IF                                                                         
END-PROC                                                                        
